# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Notes
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Maintenance (Lesson 7.1) - drain transit A, then shut the session:
#   set / network-instance default protocols bgp group TRANSIT export-policy [ MAINT-GSHUT DNA-64496 UPSTREAM-OUT ]
#   ... wait for traffic to move, then:
#   set / network-instance default protocols bgp neighbor 198.51.100.1 admin-state disable
#
# Safe changes: "enter candidate private", "diff", then
# "commit confirmed" and "commit now" once verified (automatic rollback
# if the confirmation never comes).
#
# Checks:
#   show network-instance default protocols bgp neighbor 198.51.100.1 advertised-routes ipv4
#   show network-instance default protocols bgp neighbor 198.51.100.1 received-routes ipv4
#   info from state network-instance default protocols bgp neighbor 198.51.100.9 afi-safi ipv4-unicast
